 "inter": [],
 "structural_change": "NEW master: SFU programme store (both fixed SFU calendars, 11 stripes x 2 pages = 22 ot_sram_1r1w_1024x256) split out of ot_hgi_sfu_scheduled_engine (main 697997629, split equivalence receipt results/rtl/hbm_sfu_split_1016) for die slot sfus_<q>. Each stripe = one row of two back-to-back SRAMs (W MY, E R0) whose rd_out faces a shared 40 um logic channel; the 222-bit stripe word runs west along its own 20 um row channel to the W-face output registers toward sfucore_<q>; host cfg/start on N. | r1 gate (41fbe28f5) TritonCTS: 16 buffers per path, TT insertion 565.8..745.2 ps / spread 179.4 over 447x1024 um -> pre-placed balanced clock spine from the W-centre entry; N host pins spread (cfg_data / io_cfg_data ranged across the face, were clustered in 40 um); W output ranges aligned to the stripe rows (io_word rows 0-2, compiler_control rows 3-10).",
